ta/grant-county"],["ARC or PLC in Grant County","/arc-plc/south-dakota/grant-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids in Grant County came in under 90% of normal for January to February in 40 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025, June to July ran 170% of normal on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, February to March came in at 53% of normal on the middle. Every grid had its driest year in 1976, and grids 30134 and 30135 got just 36% of normal that year.</p>"}
